{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "310186bb-bcad-8b90-8161-f0cc6c931e17",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T11:21:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin. I'm calling about a pothole, and I have three things. First, where it is. Second, that it's already been patched once. And third, I'd like to know when it gets fixed for real."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, go ahead. Where's it at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 229 Harrison Avenue, on the Fort Adams side. Right in front of the house, basically at the edge of the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two twenty-nine Harrison. Got it. And you said it was patched already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Somebody put cold patch in there last week, and it's gone. Washed right out. First, it rained, and second, I guess it never packed down, because now the hole is bigger than it was before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, cold patch will do that, especially this time of year with the freezing and thawing. Bigger than before, noting that. Any idea how deep?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deep enough that a bus just hit it and the whole thing rattled. It's on a bus route, so that's one more reason somebody should look at it. Buses come through here all day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, on a bus route, that helps. I'll put that in the notes so it gets flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So, how long do repairs usually take? Like, are we talking days, weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the weather and how many are on the list. Winter, it's mostly cold patch until it warms up enough for hot asphalt. A crew could get back out in a few days, but the permanent fix is usually later, when the plants open in the spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spring. Great. Okay. Oh, and one more thing. I got a text this morning from a number I don't know, something about a road repair. I ignored it. Was that you guys?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I know of. If it's from a number you don't recognize, I'd just leave it alone. Don't click anything in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I figured. Yeah, I'm not touching it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I've got 229 Harrison Avenue, washed-out patch, bigger hole, bus route. Want me to use the number you're calling from if the crew has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:21:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 0184. I'll get this in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:21:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T11:21:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care."
    }
  ],
